Z||000000||rockcrawl||05-02-2001||09:14 PM||||I got an Email today about a new kit for Fieros. It looks very impressive but it's way out of my price range at this time. I'll let the pictures tell the rest of the story. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Concept-C-GT.jpg"> <BR>The Concept C-GT engine bay is HUGE! Allowing you enough space to use just about any engine you want!<P>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<BR> HURRY!  For a limited time you can get BOTH the INTERIOR and EXTERIOR kits for just $11,995 Plus Shipping<BR>if you order your kit before MAY 15, 2001!  All kits are shipped from CA. <P>Note: The combined price of these kits is expected to INCREASE after 5/15/01.  <P><BR>Additional items also available, sold separately:<P>Accessory kit:<BR>LED BRAKE LIGHT -- fits inside third light box that goes between humps behind seats.<BR>FRONT LIGHT KIT -- four aluminum rings and bulbs <BR>FRONT BUMPER FOG LIGHTS<BR>FRONT GRILLS -- three pieces<BR>MUFFLER CAPS<BR>TOTAL PRICE FOR ALL OF THE ABOVE:  $669.00<P>Wheels and Tires (pictured on the finished Concept C-GT) -- $2,100<P>Wheel adapters (spacers) -- $550<P>RECEIVE A 3 DAY 2 NIGHT LAS VEGAS EXTRAVAGANZA FOR TWO WITH PURCHASE.<P>Contact: A.L Crawford<P>Phone: 219.234.4221<P>Email: theeaceman@juno.com<P><BR>||||reg||14
