Z||000008||Nashco||05-02-2001||11:18 PM||||Wow, that is an awesome kit!  I saw the real car in person at the Detroit Auto Show, and it is an amazing car!  I can't say anything bad about this kit, these guys have obviously busted their chops to get this kit looking so good and released so quickly.  I think it would be the ultimate "show off" car if you had it done before they were even released too...talk about double takes everywhere!  If I had the cash, I would drop it on this project in a heartbeat!  Well done to them, and I cannot wait to see one of these in person!!!!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
